Scenario "resize_roundtrip"
Command "andiron-fixture"
Terminal rows 6 cols 16
Cursor row 1 col 1

Step "show prompt"
WaitFrontendLineStartsWith "maqi>" timeout 5000ms
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>···········|
  r01 |················|
  r02 |················|
  r03 |················|
  r04 |················|
  r05 |················|

Step "type a wrapped input"
Input "abcdefghijklmnop"
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·abcdefghij|
  r01 |klmnop··········|
  r02 |················|
  r03 |················|
  r04 |················|
  r05 |················|

Step "narrow the terminal"
Resize rows 6 cols 8
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·ab|
  r01 |cdefghij|
  r02 |klmnop··|
  r03 |········|
  r04 |········|
  r05 |········|

Step "shrink the terminal height"
Resize rows 3 cols 8
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·ab|
  r01 |cdefghij|
  r02 |klmnop··|

Step "restore original dimensions"
Resize rows 6 cols 16
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·abcdefghij|
  r01 |klmnop··········|
  r02 |················|
  r03 |················|
  r04 |················|
  r05 |················|

Step "insert in the middle after resizing"
Input left 8
Input "X"
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·abcdefghXi|
  r01 |jklmnop·········|
  r02 |················|
  r03 |················|
  r04 |················|
  r05 |················|
